{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 73,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of Asaph. Truly God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good to Israel, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to such as are of a clean heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But as for me, my feet were almost gone; my steps had well nigh slipped.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I was envious at the foolish, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "when",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I saw the prosperity of the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no bands in their death: but their strength ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " firm.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not in trouble ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as other",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " men; neither are they afflicted like ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "other",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore pride encompasseth them as a chain; violence covereth them ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a garment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their eyes stand out with fatness: they have more than heart could wish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are corrupt, and speak wickedly ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "concerning",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " oppression: they speak loftily.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They set their mouth against the heavens, and their tongue walketh through the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore his people return hither: and waters of a full ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "cup",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " are wrung out to them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they say, How doth God know? and is there knowledge in the Most High?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the ungodly, who prosper in the world; they increase ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " riches.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Verily I have cleansed my heart ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " vain, and washed my hands in innocence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For all the day long have I been afflicted, and chastened every morning.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I say, I will speak thus; behold, I should offend ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "against",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the generation of thy children.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I thought to know this, it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " too painful for me;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Until I went into the sanctuary of God; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "then",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I understood their end.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely thou didst set them in slippery places: thou didst cast them down into destruction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How are they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "brought",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " into desolation, as in a moment! they are utterly consumed with terrors.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As a dream when ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " awaketh; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", O LORD, when thou awakest, thou wilt despise their image.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus my heart was grieved, and I was pricked in my reins.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So foolish ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I, and ignorant: I was ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a beast before thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " continually with thee: thou hast held ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by my right hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt guide me with thy counsel, and afterward receive me ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whom have I in heaven ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "? and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " none upon earth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I desire besides thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My flesh and my heart faileth: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the strength of my heart, and my portion for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For lo, they that are far from thee shall perish: thou hast destroyed all them that go astray from thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.73.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.73.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good for me to draw near to God: I have put my trust in the Lord GOD, that I may declare all thy works.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
